MoE design choice: **8 experts, top-2 routing** (standard Mixtral-style ratio), giving ~7B total params with ~2.3B active per token — i.e. 1B dense-equivalent compute at the FFN capacity of a dense 1B model. `capacity_factor=1.25` is the common buffer for top-2 token load; since I'm not sharing experts across layers, I use per-layer expert parallel sharding.

```json
